1
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,000
<i>Door is unlocked.</i>

2
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:48,800
<i>Yoo-shin, my darling,</i>

3
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,760
<i>today is your 11th birthday.</i>

4
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:55,599
<i>I made your favorite sponge cake</i>

5
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,040
<i>to celebrate with you.</i>

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,080
<i>I miss you.</i>

7
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:04,080
<i>Hope you grow up safe</i>

8
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:05,880
<i>and happy.</i>

9
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:08,800
<i>Find joy every day.</i>

10
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:50,720
I just bought it.

11
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,600
Hey!

12
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,320
Who is it?

13
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:08,480
Not opening the door?

14
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,880
- Hsu Wei-zhe.
- Help me.

15
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:13,959
Hurry,

16
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:15,320
hold his head.

17
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,239
Wasn't she first? Why him?

18
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:20,599
He caught me. What else could I do?
Help me!

19
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,160
How can I help?

20
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:26,439
Tie him up.

21
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:27,599
Hide him from An-an.

22
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,600
Keep An-an away.

23
00:04:29,320 --> 00:04:32,799
Hsu Wei-zhe, don't walk away.

24
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,239
You're leaving him with me?

25
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:36,399
Aren't you afraid he'll hurt me and An-an?

26
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:37,639
You can do it.

27
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:39,519
If you can't, use this.

28
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:41,560
Use this. It'll work.

29
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:44,519
Is this your plan?

30
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:46,680
We'll succeed.

31
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,840
2:00 a.m. tonight?

32
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:54,519
Or tomorrow? The day after? I don't know.

33
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,880
Wait for me.

34
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:57,800
Love you.

35
00:04:58,800 --> 00:04:59,880
Hsu Wei-zhe!

36
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:24,680
<i>Operation failed.</i>

37
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,800
<i>Door is unlocked.</i>

38
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:39,120
PSYCHIATRY CLINIC

39
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,720
You're back?

40
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:05,040
What are you making in there?

41
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,520
It's all clean now.

42
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:22,280
What happened to your arm?

43
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:28,000
I scraped it on the sink. I'm fine.

44
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:30,560
Why didn't you call a plumber?

45
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:32,760
I did.

46
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,920
I called many times,

47
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:36,800
but no one answered.

48
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,440
Be careful next time.

49
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:52,880
Don't lose it again.

50
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,480
Thanks.

51
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,559
Lee Yun.

52
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,960
Lee Yun!

53
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:53,120
I just saw my exact double.

54
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:56,880
Untie me!

55
00:08:58,640 --> 00:08:59,920
Hurry, untie me.

56
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:07,159
Hey, stay still.

57
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:08,200
Stay still.

58
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:11,920
What are you doing?

59
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,320
I'm not Lee Yun.

60
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:19,800
My husband brought you here.

61
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,520
Okay.

62
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:27,600
Okay.

63
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,360
Untie me.

64
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:33,200
We can leave together, okay?

65
00:09:35,160 --> 00:09:37,040
Free or not, you can't go back.

66
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,640
Maybe at midnight.

67
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:43,880
But I don't know
if the mirror will crack then.

68
00:09:47,160 --> 00:09:48,560
So we go back now

69
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,840
and see if the mirror cracks.

70
00:09:52,280 --> 00:09:54,039
Stop. Don't move.

71
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:55,319
Another world, right?

72
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:57,280
Don't move. Stay still.

73
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,120
Let's go.

74
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,759
Teacher, my dad's home.

75
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:50,679
Goodbye, teacher.

76
00:10:50,680 --> 00:10:52,120
Dad!

77
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:07,400
Can we play catch today?

78
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:09,320
No!

79
00:11:09,880 --> 00:11:11,239
Come here.

80
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,240
Dad has a cold.

81
00:11:13,240 --> 00:11:14,399
It's contagious.

82
00:11:14,400 --> 00:11:15,720
Go take a shower.

83
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,480
Hurry, go.

84
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,800
<i>Yoo-shin, Daddy's home.</i>

85
00:11:35,520 --> 00:11:37,000
Are you drawing a moth?

86
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,480
Can Daddy have a hug?

87
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:41,359
Come, give me a hug.

88
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:42,400
Come here.

89
00:12:01,520 --> 00:12:03,279
Smog's coming. Close the door.

90
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:04,760
Are you coming in or not?

91
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:35,079
Hurry.

92
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:37,399
Didn't I tell you to get undressed?

93
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:39,679
I know. I'm taking them off.

94
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:41,200
You're asking for it.

95
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:43,920
Why won't it heal?

96
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:46,159
Stop scratching.

97
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:47,479
It's really itchy.

98
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,679
I'm not the only one.

99
00:12:48,680 --> 00:12:51,040
I'll apply some medicine
after your shower, okay?

100
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:12,639
Lee Yun.

101
00:14:12,640 --> 00:14:14,639
Can you hear me, Lee Yun?

102
00:14:14,640 --> 00:14:16,200
The mirror didn't crack.

103
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:18,320
What you saw wasn't her.

104
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,759
When can I go home?

105
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:28,080
- How long will I be here?
- You're not being held.

106
00:14:28,760 --> 00:14:30,680
You can leave whenever you want.

107
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:37,920
Yours,

108
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,400
yours,

109
00:14:39,680 --> 00:14:40,720
and yours.

110
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:46,640
Shower first.

111
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,720
Laundry after dinner.

112
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:51,240
Where's my wife?

113
00:14:52,400 --> 00:14:53,440
Did you hurt her?

114
00:14:57,640 --> 00:14:58,720
I didn't.

115
00:15:16,400 --> 00:15:17,999
<i>Where are my gray sweats?</i>

116
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,480
I need them tomorrow.

117
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:23,639
I saw you wear them days ago.

118
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:26,240
Why didn't you take them off
for me to wash?

119
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:28,760
You're wrong.

120
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,800
I haven't worn them in ages.

121
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,600
You're really something.

122
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:37,080
Even managed to lose my clothes.

123
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,519
<i>13.</i>

124
00:15:56,520 --> 00:15:57,799
<i>21.</i>

125
00:15:57,800 --> 00:15:58,880
<i>34.</i>

126
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:01,519
<i>89.</i>

127
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:02,799
<i>144.</i>

128
00:16:02,800 --> 00:16:03,920
<i>233.</i>

129
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:06,239
<i>233.</i>

130
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,240
What's that?

131
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:11,520
I'm watching videos from my cloud.

132
00:16:12,280 --> 00:16:14,039
My old phone was too slow,

133
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:15,160
new one's great.

134
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:21,840
<i>- 233.
- Yoo-shin, Dad's boss is calling.</i>

135
00:16:22,840 --> 00:16:24,399
<i>Faye-bo's dad.</i>

136
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:27,640
<i>- Faye-bo's dad.
- Okay.</i>

137
00:16:29,520 --> 00:16:31,440
Stop watching and come eat.

138
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:38,440
We're eating at Dad's tomorrow.

139
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:43,840
I…

140
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:46,480
I want to…

141
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:49,240
go there tonight.

142
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:52,760
I want to bring An-an here.

143
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,440
Dad…

144
00:17:04,839 --> 00:17:06,560
texted me a few times.

145
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:08,960
He said it's been ages.

146
00:17:10,280 --> 00:17:11,520
I'm sorry.

147
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:15,240
I don't know when I'll be back.

148
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:24,560
I'll go with you.

149
00:17:26,319 --> 00:17:27,480
Dr. Jian told me

150
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:31,640
to hear you out

151
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:34,360
and stay by your side.

152
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:37,400
If another world really exists,

153
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:41,000
I don't want you facing it alone.

154
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,360
I'd be worried.

155
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:50,640
Someone looks just like Yoo-shin.

156
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,320
I want to see him too.

157
00:17:57,680 --> 00:17:59,360
You think I don't miss him?

158
00:18:07,360 --> 00:18:09,000
I'll go see who it is.

159
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:20,760
Sis-in-law.

160
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:22,800
- Da-jun.
- Is brother home?

161
00:18:23,360 --> 00:18:26,559
Yeah, we're eating. Have you eaten yet?

162
00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:28,999
I'm full. Sorry for interrupting.

163
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,079
Bro.

164
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:32,479
He's dropping something off
and leaving soon.

165
00:18:32,480 --> 00:18:34,600
Go eat. The food's getting cold.

166
00:18:36,280 --> 00:18:38,360
It's okay, go eat first.

167
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:41,480
Sure.

168
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:48,400
What is it?

169
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:51,600
The contract.

170
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:53,959
THE REAL ESTATE CONTRACT

171
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:56,159
Read it over and let me know.

172
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:57,919
No exclusivity needed.

173
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:59,920
- A regular agreement is fine.
- No.

174
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:07,720
Didn't I say wait?

175
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:10,560
- Right.
- Right.

176
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:12,479
- Right.
- Right.

177
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:14,159
But that was yesterday.

178
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,679
You changed your mind

179
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:18,119
this afternoon and asked me to bring

180
00:19:18,120 --> 00:19:19,200
the contract.

181
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:23,520
- Right.
- Right.

182
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,880
Sorry.

183
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:28,280
I shouldn't have wavered.

184
00:19:29,600 --> 00:19:31,639
She really messed with my head.

185
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:35,319
But she seemed fine when I saw her.
She looked normal.

186
00:19:35,320 --> 00:19:36,520
That's just a front.

187
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:39,079
I've been tending to her all day.

188
00:19:39,080 --> 00:19:40,599
She's really struggling.

189
00:19:40,600 --> 00:19:44,479
I've taken days off to stay with her
and go to therapy with her.

190
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:47,160
Her mood swings are bad.
She worries all day. I…

191
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:51,719
- I'm sorry.
- No, it's fine.

192
00:19:51,720 --> 00:19:53,320
Take care, bro.

193
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:56,640
Review the contract and let me know.

194
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:59,359
She needs me now.

195
00:19:59,360 --> 00:20:01,359
- Okay, go.
- I won't walk you out.

196
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:02,600
- No need.
- Sorry.

197
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,959
Luckily it rained,

198
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:28,640
so the smog cleared faster.

199
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:37,840
Do you often get smog there?

200
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:41,280
When can I go back?

201
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:43,320
When it cracks?

202
00:20:44,120 --> 00:20:45,240
I don't know.

203
00:20:47,640 --> 00:20:50,959
Sometimes my husband disappears for days

204
00:20:50,960 --> 00:20:52,280
and I can't reach him.

205
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:54,920
I've lived here for years.

206
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,480
I've never seen it crack.

207
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:11,119
He said it started after

208
00:21:11,120 --> 00:21:13,600
our basement bathroom was remodeled

209
00:21:15,160 --> 00:21:16,160
five months ago.

210
00:21:16,680 --> 00:21:18,240
The first time he saw you

211
00:21:19,080 --> 00:21:20,160
was at night.

212
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:25,200
He said you cried.

213
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:39,320
He took my rings and watch.

214
00:21:40,200 --> 00:21:41,400
What does he want?

215
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:48,399
He's just mad your wife
wants to take An-an away.

216
00:21:48,400 --> 00:21:49,599
- So--
- So?

217
00:21:49,600 --> 00:21:51,560
- Will he hurt my wife?
- No.

218
00:21:53,080 --> 00:21:55,560
He just wants to change your wife's mind.

219
00:21:57,160 --> 00:21:58,920
He's not a violent person.

220
00:22:11,760 --> 00:22:12,920
This is his, right?

221
00:22:16,200 --> 00:22:17,680
I found it in my pocket.

222
00:23:53,680 --> 00:23:54,639
Jian-cheng?

223
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:55,640
Yes?

224
00:23:58,760 --> 00:24:00,440
Yoo-shin's sketchbook is missing.

225
00:24:01,160 --> 00:24:02,560
The January 2022 one.

226
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:05,719
Did you put it somewhere and forget?

227
00:24:05,720 --> 00:24:06,919
No way.

228
00:24:06,920 --> 00:24:09,800
I organize Yoo-shin's things.
I wouldn't misplace them.

229
00:24:13,320 --> 00:24:14,560
Someone entered our house.

230
00:24:16,240 --> 00:24:17,839
Don't be so paranoid.

231
00:24:17,840 --> 00:24:18,759
No.

232
00:24:18,760 --> 00:24:20,960
If I can go there, she can come here too.

233
00:24:21,520 --> 00:24:22,640
Who?

234
00:24:23,240 --> 00:24:25,719
That person who looks just like me.

235
00:24:25,720 --> 00:24:27,520
I keep losing things at home.

236
00:24:29,360 --> 00:24:30,520
It must be her.

237
00:24:33,160 --> 00:24:34,160
Okay.

238
00:24:35,600 --> 00:24:36,800
If that's true,

239
00:24:37,440 --> 00:24:39,640
what's her reason for doing this?

240
00:24:43,680 --> 00:24:45,879
Then why are things disappearing?

241
00:24:45,880 --> 00:24:48,639
Maybe you put it somewhere and forgot.

242
00:24:48,640 --> 00:24:50,320
I'll help you look tomorrow.

243
00:24:51,640 --> 00:24:54,120
You look awful. Go rest.

244
00:24:55,480 --> 00:24:58,040
I'll call you if the mirror cracks, okay?

245
00:25:02,480 --> 00:25:03,680
Go rest.

246
00:26:38,120 --> 00:26:39,559
It's almost 3:00 a.m.

247
00:26:39,560 --> 00:26:41,760
The mirror didn't crack. Go to sleep.

248
00:26:47,480 --> 00:26:48,520
Get some rest.

249
00:27:10,800 --> 00:27:11,840
<i>Wei-zhe.</i>

250
00:27:30,080 --> 00:27:35,720
WE'RE OFF TO WORK AND SCHOOL.
DON'T FORGET YOUR KEYS.

251
00:27:42,200 --> 00:27:46,480
HSU WEI-ZHE

252
00:27:50,080 --> 00:27:51,160
<i>Wei-zhe.</i>

253
00:27:57,280 --> 00:27:58,360
<i>Wei-zhe.</i>

254
00:28:04,760 --> 00:28:05,800
<i>Wei-zhe.</i>

255
00:28:21,760 --> 00:28:22,800
Hello?

256
00:28:25,920 --> 00:28:27,040
<i>Hello?</i>

257
00:28:31,960 --> 00:28:33,000
Hello?

258
00:28:34,600 --> 00:28:35,640
Hello?

259
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:40,280
Hello?

260
00:28:49,560 --> 00:28:50,600
Hello?

261
00:29:36,880 --> 00:29:39,959
You came back yesterday, didn't you?
Why didn't you come down?

262
00:29:39,960 --> 00:29:43,120
- Are you okay?
- It hurts.

263
00:29:56,480 --> 00:29:57,520
I…

264
00:29:58,400 --> 00:30:00,120
I'll get something to clean…

265
00:30:42,040 --> 00:30:43,400
Don't worry.

266
00:30:46,640 --> 00:30:49,360
I'll be out of the hospital soon.

267
00:30:51,400 --> 00:30:53,600
Study hard, okay?

268
00:30:57,600 --> 00:31:01,200
Don't cry. It hurts Mommy to see you cry.

269
00:31:14,800 --> 00:31:18,239
- Jian-cheng.
- Didn't you say you'd be home soon?

270
00:31:18,240 --> 00:31:20,759
Jian-cheng, let go.

271
00:31:20,760 --> 00:31:23,800
You can't do this.

272
00:31:24,440 --> 00:31:27,439
She'll be torn apart, Jian-cheng.

273
00:31:27,440 --> 00:31:29,680
Didn't you say you'd be back soon?

274
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:36,200
Haven't been here in ages.

275
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:39,239
I wanted you to see the ocean.

276
00:31:39,240 --> 00:31:41,319
When it warms up,

277
00:31:41,320 --> 00:31:42,920
I'll take you to the beach.

278
00:31:45,080 --> 00:31:46,200
I'll get

279
00:31:46,760 --> 00:31:49,999
a new smart lock installed

280
00:31:50,000 --> 00:31:51,439
in a few days.

281
00:31:51,440 --> 00:31:52,999
It's connected online,

282
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:55,600
so we'll know whenever
someone comes or goes.

283
00:31:57,280 --> 00:32:00,280
After what you said yesterday,
I still feel uneasy.

284
00:32:02,600 --> 00:32:06,040
Then if Yoo-shin comes back,
he won't be able to get in.

285
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:09,520
We can install a camera outside the door.

286
00:32:10,120 --> 00:32:11,640
I'll find a way.

287
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:17,560
And don't mention this to of Yu-jhen.

288
00:32:18,240 --> 00:32:20,280
It'll scare her.

289
00:32:23,400 --> 00:32:24,480
I know.

290
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:57,880
What happened?

291
00:33:00,640 --> 00:33:01,759
What's wrong?

292
00:33:01,760 --> 00:33:02,800
Nothing.

293
00:33:14,520 --> 00:33:17,520
- You're back?
- Dad.

294
00:33:20,040 --> 00:33:21,080
Dad.

295
00:33:22,080 --> 00:33:24,000
See? My timing was perfect.

296
00:33:56,320 --> 00:33:57,399
Come in.

297
00:33:57,400 --> 00:33:59,400
- We're about to eat.
- Okay.

298
00:34:03,640 --> 00:34:04,999
Go in.

299
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:06,160
Why wait?

300
00:34:26,320 --> 00:34:27,959
What are you looking at?

301
00:34:27,960 --> 00:34:29,120
Give me a hand.

302
00:34:30,440 --> 00:34:32,319
Don't blame me for being cold.

303
00:34:32,320 --> 00:34:33,960
You two look exactly alike.

304
00:34:37,719 --> 00:34:39,520
He ordered all of this,

305
00:34:40,120 --> 00:34:43,039
saying he had lots of customers
and good profit margins.

306
00:34:43,040 --> 00:34:44,320
He wanted to get rich.

307
00:34:45,360 --> 00:34:46,440
But now?

308
00:34:46,960 --> 00:34:48,760
Who's here doing all the work?

309
00:34:49,760 --> 00:34:53,198
Those masks cost a fortune
and still haven't been sold.

310
00:34:53,199 --> 00:34:55,920
Now others are making cheaper,
better ones.

311
00:34:59,920 --> 00:35:01,199
Move.

312
00:35:01,200 --> 00:35:04,440
Need to cook, deliver,
then help my mother-in-law bathe.

313
00:35:13,320 --> 00:35:15,280
I saw your mother-in-law's scar.

314
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:19,359
That wasn't me.

315
00:35:19,360 --> 00:35:21,880
Wei-zhe's dad burned her
with hot water before.

316
00:35:26,040 --> 00:35:27,040
I'm home.

317
00:35:32,680 --> 00:35:34,040
Dad!

318
00:35:36,400 --> 00:35:38,160
Is your cold better?

319
00:35:50,880 --> 00:35:52,159
Dad,

320
00:35:52,160 --> 00:35:54,960
I finished my homework. Can we play catch?

321
00:36:04,160 --> 00:36:05,080
Kiss!

322
00:36:09,120 --> 00:36:11,519
Yay! Dad's going to play catch with me.

323
00:36:11,520 --> 00:36:13,440
Dad, guess what?

324
00:36:14,120 --> 00:36:15,760
I'm really good now.

325
00:36:16,480 --> 00:36:18,560
I throw the farthest in my class.

326
00:36:18,680 --> 00:36:19,880
Pretty cool, right?

327
00:36:21,600 --> 00:36:23,919
Dad, go over there.

328
00:36:23,920 --> 00:36:25,320
I'll throw first.

329
00:36:26,600 --> 00:36:29,639
No need to fold it. We'll use it tonight.

330
00:36:29,640 --> 00:36:31,119
No.

331
00:36:31,120 --> 00:36:34,080
Make the bed right, even for tonight.

332
00:36:35,920 --> 00:36:36,960
Yu-jhen,

333
00:36:37,760 --> 00:36:40,760
please, make the bed when you get up too.

334
00:36:45,320 --> 00:36:47,440
And look at these clothes.

335
00:36:51,720 --> 00:36:53,839
Is it really that hard for a girl

336
00:36:53,840 --> 00:36:57,040
to spend ten minutes a day
looking presentable?

337
00:36:58,560 --> 00:37:00,200
Then move to Taipei. Live with us.

338
00:37:00,960 --> 00:37:04,279
You can fold my blankets
and clothes every day.

339
00:37:04,280 --> 00:37:05,920
I'll let you handle it all.

340
00:37:09,280 --> 00:37:11,000
You're in a good mood today.

341
00:37:14,960 --> 00:37:16,960
I don't want Grandpa to worry.

342
00:37:22,840 --> 00:37:24,960
I haven't been there for you.

343
00:37:27,560 --> 00:37:28,600
I got goosebumps.

344
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:33,120
Don't talk about the past anymore.

345
00:37:34,120 --> 00:37:35,880
You'll just get upset again.

346
00:37:45,280 --> 00:37:46,320
It's still hot.

347
00:37:48,360 --> 00:37:49,439
Let me cut it.

348
00:37:49,440 --> 00:37:51,120
No, I'll do it.

349
00:37:58,920 --> 00:38:01,360
A friend recommended a doctor.

350
00:38:02,200 --> 00:38:04,040
Take Lee Yun to see him.

351
00:38:06,240 --> 00:38:07,560
I can't hear you.

352
00:38:08,240 --> 00:38:09,560
Let's talk later.

353
00:38:18,160 --> 00:38:19,160
I said…

354
00:38:22,040 --> 00:38:24,200
Your mom is useless.

355
00:38:25,200 --> 00:38:26,280
So are you.

356
00:38:27,640 --> 00:38:28,640
I said…

357
00:38:29,800 --> 00:38:31,440
this doctor is very patient

358
00:38:32,560 --> 00:38:33,600
and professional.

359
00:38:34,240 --> 00:38:36,879
I heard he's also developing some

360
00:38:36,880 --> 00:38:38,720
experimental treatments abroad.

361
00:38:46,960 --> 00:38:48,360
You hit me?

362
00:38:49,440 --> 00:38:51,519
My own child hits me?

363
00:38:51,520 --> 00:38:52,759
Who taught you? Mom?

364
00:38:52,760 --> 00:38:53,839
That bitch!

365
00:38:53,840 --> 00:38:55,680
Bitch, you're dead!

366
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:03,799
Look at how you cut it.

367
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:05,120
Come on, I'll cut it.

368
00:39:07,480 --> 00:39:08,600
Jian-cheng.

369
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:11,560
Jian-cheng.

370
00:39:12,640 --> 00:39:13,720
I'll do it.

371
00:39:17,160 --> 00:39:18,600
Go rest. I'll cut it.

372
00:39:30,200 --> 00:39:31,680
You dare defy me?

373
00:39:32,320 --> 00:39:34,719
Try it. See if I won't kill you.

374
00:39:34,720 --> 00:39:38,959
Come back for money again
or touch my mom again and I'll kill you!

375
00:39:38,960 --> 00:39:39,879
Bring it on!

376
00:39:39,880 --> 00:39:42,639
<i>No one hurts my mom!</i>

377
00:39:42,640 --> 00:39:43,880
<i>Don't touch her!</i>

378
00:40:06,040 --> 00:40:08,200
Whenever I make this crispy pork belly,

379
00:40:09,040 --> 00:40:11,559
Jian-cheng eats three bowls at least.

380
00:40:11,560 --> 00:40:15,000
- Grandpa, you've said that a lot.
- Really?

381
00:40:16,120 --> 00:40:17,160
Okay.

382
00:40:19,600 --> 00:40:22,600
Jian-cheng said
you're taking your medicine again.

383
00:40:26,520 --> 00:40:27,959
I stopped taking it.

384
00:40:27,960 --> 00:40:29,520
Why stop your meds?

385
00:40:30,320 --> 00:40:33,079
You can't stop
without your doctor's advice.

386
00:40:33,080 --> 00:40:35,440
She's better. She doesn't need meds.

387
00:40:38,520 --> 00:40:39,920
Yeah, Dad.

388
00:40:40,640 --> 00:40:41,720
I'm okay.

389
00:40:42,200 --> 00:40:44,000
I feel better. I'm not sick.

390
00:40:45,240 --> 00:40:47,320
I told Jian-cheng a friend recommended

391
00:40:47,920 --> 00:40:50,999
a great doctor.

392
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:53,040
You should see him

393
00:40:54,440 --> 00:40:56,520
and get a second opinion.

394
00:40:57,600 --> 00:40:59,160
Your health comes first.

395
00:41:17,800 --> 00:41:18,840
Jian-cheng,

396
00:41:19,440 --> 00:41:20,560
Jian-cheng!

397
00:41:21,160 --> 00:41:22,240
What's wrong?

398
00:41:26,280 --> 00:41:28,200
I remembered I need to make a call.

399
00:41:28,880 --> 00:41:30,040
Go ahead and eat.

400
00:41:30,720 --> 00:41:32,080
You eat first.

401
00:41:39,200 --> 00:41:40,440
Wei-zhe,

402
00:41:42,360 --> 00:41:43,760
help.

403
00:41:44,600 --> 00:41:45,720
Help…

404
00:42:09,400 --> 00:42:10,440
I'm back now.

405
00:42:23,880 --> 00:42:24,920
Wait here.

406
00:42:25,880 --> 00:42:27,159
I'll go in first.

407
00:42:27,160 --> 00:42:28,240
Come in after.

408
00:43:39,120 --> 00:43:40,360
You're amazing.

409
00:43:42,680 --> 00:43:43,840
Same face,

410
00:43:46,720 --> 00:43:47,840
same fingerprints.

411
00:43:58,640 --> 00:44:02,759
I'M NOT TRYING TO INTERFERE IN YOUR LIFE.
I JUST WORRY ABOUT YOU.

412
00:44:02,760 --> 00:44:07,120
IF YOU DON'T LIKE THE WATCH,
I CAN EXCHANGE IT.

413
00:44:13,520 --> 00:44:19,440
I LOVE THE WATCH.
THANK YOU.

414
00:45:06,360 --> 00:45:07,520
No need to iron it.

415
00:45:08,800 --> 00:45:09,920
No.

416
00:45:10,520 --> 00:45:13,200
This new fabric
isn't as good as the old one.

417
00:45:13,760 --> 00:45:16,400
It's my fault I lost the old one.

418
00:45:20,000 --> 00:45:21,880
Why remember such small detail?

419
00:45:24,040 --> 00:45:26,319
You were upset when you lost your clothes.

420
00:45:26,320 --> 00:45:27,840
How could I forget that?

421
00:45:36,520 --> 00:45:37,600
Sorry.

422
00:45:46,160 --> 00:45:47,720
I just talked to Dad.

423
00:45:50,480 --> 00:45:52,920
He was afraid he'd upset you
by saying too much.

424
00:45:54,960 --> 00:45:56,000
It's okay.

425
00:45:56,440 --> 00:45:59,080
I know he's just concerned about me. I do.

426
00:46:09,240 --> 00:46:11,120
I know I treated you badly.

427
00:46:13,480 --> 00:46:14,480
On Yoo-shin's

428
00:46:15,840 --> 00:46:17,520
third death anniversary.

429
00:46:20,000 --> 00:46:22,479
I shouldn't have hurt you.

430
00:46:22,480 --> 00:46:23,560
I'm sorry.

431
00:46:24,800 --> 00:46:28,560
I shouldn't have blamed you.
It wasn't your fault.

432
00:46:32,280 --> 00:46:33,360
I'm sorry.

433
00:46:34,000 --> 00:46:36,440
I promise I'll never be like this again.

434
00:46:38,200 --> 00:46:39,280
Okay?

435
00:47:11,360 --> 00:47:12,880
Whether we find him or not,

436
00:47:14,480 --> 00:47:15,680
let's start over.

437
00:47:16,800 --> 00:47:18,320
Back to how things were.

438
00:48:04,640 --> 00:48:06,400
Wait a second.
